WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.960
you are coming into my office with this resume without any projects on it.

00:03.960 --> 00:05.640
Do you really think you're going to get the job?

00:06.820 --> 00:10.400
I-I-I-I-I-I-I-I-I-I-I-I-I-I-I-I-I-I-I-I-I-I-I-I-I-I-I-I-I-I-I-I-I-I-I-I-I-I-I-I-I-I-I-I-I-I-I-I-I-I-I-I-I-I-I-I-I-I, because you're not getting this job.

00:10.400 --> 00:11.400
Get out.

00:12.340 --> 00:14.040
Run me, play the hell.

00:14.580 --> 00:16.180
Ah, not this guy again.

00:16.180 --> 00:17.700
Wait, check out my projects.

00:17.700 --> 00:18.020
Whoa!

00:18.080 --> 00:19.300
These are actually impressive.

00:19.300 --> 00:21.960
You-you've literally built everything that we had in the job description.

00:21.960 --> 00:22.800
How did he do this?

00:22.800 --> 00:25.760
What he doesn't know is that I went to learn.nextweek.org

00:25.760 --> 00:27.480
and then I just put in the job description

00:27.480 --> 00:28.720
into this box right here

00:28.720 --> 00:30.560
and I asked it to generate me projects

00:30.560 --> 00:31.440
so I can get the job.

00:31.440 --> 00:32.280
Hello.

00:32.280 --> 00:33.800
After that, I answered a few questions,

00:33.800 --> 00:36.080
generated the project and went through it step by step.

00:36.080 --> 00:37.880
The projects are way better than something

00:37.880 --> 00:39.320
clawed or tragedy would give you.

00:39.320 --> 00:40.960
Oh, and then I filled in these questions here

00:40.960 --> 00:42.000
and added in screenshots.

00:42.000 --> 00:44.920
And I could post my documentation to LinkedIn or GitHub.

00:44.920 --> 00:46.440
We even share it to losers like him.

00:46.440 --> 00:47.200
I don't know what's happening here,

00:47.200 --> 00:48.600
but you've got the job, man.

00:48.600 --> 00:49.440
I know I did.

00:49.440 --> 00:51.200
Go open the door so I can go choose my desk.

